        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-7",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Muscle pain symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Ongoing flare with increased pain over the last 2–3 weeks, involving the neck, shoulders and upper back, with occasional low-back pain. Dull ache with intermittent sharp twinges; worse at the end of the workday and after long periods at the computer. Sleep is mildly disturbed on some nights due to discomfort, but there is no true persistent night pain regularly waking the patient."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-8",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-8",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Reported red-flag and associated symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "No trauma, weight loss, fever, sweats, systemic symptoms, focal neurological symptoms (including weakness, numbness or sphincter change), chest pain, shortness of breath, abdominal pain, headache or visual change reported. Appetite is okay."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-9",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-9",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "General appearance and mobility"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Alert, well appearing, in no distress and mobilises freely."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-10",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-10",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Neck and upper-back musculoskeletal examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Mildly reduced neck rotation, limited by discomfort only. Palpable taut bands and trigger points in the upper trapezius and cervical/thoracic paraspinals reproduce the patient's typical pain. No midline spinal tenderness."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-11",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-11",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Shoulder examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Full range of motion with mild discomfort at the extremes. Strength 5/5."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-12",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-12",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Thoracic and lumbar musculoskeletal examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Localised myofascial paraspinal tenderness to palpation. No bony tenderness or step."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-13",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-13",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Neurological examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Power 5/5 in all limbs; tone and reflexes normal; reflexes symmetrical; sensation intact to light touch and pinprick. No focal deficit."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-14",
